# TheSportsDB API key. `3` is the public free-tier key, which is also the default in nuxt.config.ts; a premium key raises the free tier's limits.
NUXT_PUBLIC_SPORTSDB_API_KEY=3

# Which League list the page shows when the URL has no `source`: `live` (TheSportsDB) or `fixture` (the registered sample list for the degraded free tier, shown with a banner). Defaults to `live` in nuxt.config.ts.
NUXT_PUBLIC_LEAGUE_SOURCE=live
